  m_Name: case_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 5
  context: "THE DESECRATION OF DELACROIX\u2019S TOMB\nDuring the night from Tuesday
    to Wednesday, the slab of the Delacroix family\u2019s tomb in Saint-Louis cemetery
    was moved and the gold medallion of the late \xC9l\xE9onore Delacroix disappeared.
    The guard discovered the facts at 7:15 a.m. on Wednesday. The gate had been closed
    since 6 p.m. and its lock is intact. The heirs of the family have been arguing
    for years. Ten people related to the cemetery or the family must be questioned."
  facts: "Gate closed at 6:00 p.m., lock intact and 80 kg door moved with a steel
    lever and red clay door in aisle 6. \nEntrance camera out of service since Tuesday
    at 3 p.m. \nA dog barked around 12:30 a.m. at a nearby climbing site on the wall
    on the street side of Moulin\nBrume \xE9paisse all night."
  suspects:
